diff --git a/.scratch/crossgain-repair/spec.md b/.scratch/crossgain-repair/spec.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..2654672a7f199d2826d4c014692a7d5da4c5f41f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.scratch/crossgain-repair/spec.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# Cross-gain repair completion criterion
+
+The Stage-C information-twin acceptance seam must prove that two coalition
+contexts with identical scalar features serialize to byte-identical payloads
+when their pairwise cross-gain block is zeroed, while their full canonical
+pairwise blocks differ and the set-conditioned head learns opposite-sign
+interaction values. Coalition shards must bind an explicit new context schema
+version and report expected versus actual versions on drift. The complete
+Stage-C test suite must pass.
+
+Mutation boundary: `src/mcrl/stagec_v025/` learner/context code,
+`scripts/run_v025_pilot_c3.py`, Stage-C tests, this scratch criterion, and the
+requested root report. Physics, thresholds, signs, seeds, horizons, prices,
+guards, and acceptance rules are immutable.
